<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Dongmyeong of Buyeo</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Dongmyeong is the legendary founder of Buyeo, an ancient kingdom of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/manchuria">Manchuria</a>. In the version recorded by Chinese writers from the 1st century CE, he was born to a servant woman of a northern kingdom after she was touched by a beam of sunlight, and escaped the king's pursuit across a river on a bridge of fish and turtles. The story was later adapted for Jumong, founder of Goguryeo.</p></div>
